# What git does not track in this repository.
#
# NOTE: An ignore rule does not untrack a file that git already tracks.
# Check with `git ls-files` after you add a rule.

# -- Secrets. Never committed. ---------------------------------------------
# These rules exist before the files do, so a credential file cannot be
# staged by accident. `cargo xtask check secrets` also reads the files that
# are not tracked and not ignored.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.dev.vars
.dev.vars.*
!.dev.vars.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.keystore
id_rsa
id_ed25519
credentials.json
service-account*.json
*.token
.*_token
.*-token

# -- Work areas of the tooling ----------------------------------------------
# Reference trees that `cargo xtask refs fetch` clones at their pinned
# commits. docs/references.md holds the pins, so a tree can be fetched again.
.refs/
# Throwaway work: spike programs, measurement output, keys made for one test.
.work/
.tmp/
tmp/
scratch/
.scratch/

# -- Logs, local databases, test output -------------------------------------
*.log
logs/
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.sqlite-journal
*.sqlite-wal
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
coverage/
test-results/

# -- Local files of agent tools ---------------------------------------------
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/worktrees/
CLAUDE.local.md
.codegraph/

# -- Windows reserved device names ------------------------------------------
# A shell redirect such as 2>/dev/null under a shell that does not map it, or
# a tool that passes NUL as a file name under Git Bash, makes a real file with
# one of these names. git cannot stash such a file, and rm cannot delete it.
nul
CON
PRN
AUX
NUL
COM[1-9]
LPT[1-9]
CON.*
PRN.*
AUX.*
NUL.*
COM[1-9].*
LPT[1-9].*

# -- Rust ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Cargo.lock is tracked: the binaries need reproducible builds.
/target/
**/*.rs.bk
*.pdb

# -- Operating system and editor files ---------------------------------------
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
._*
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
*.lnk
.directory
.Trash-*
.nfs*
.vscode/
.idea/
*.iml
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.history/
.fleet/
